msgstr "Taneɣruft n wawal (awal icuban deg umawal): "

#: src/tools/hunspell.cxx:1532
msgid "Model word must be in the dictionary. Press any key!"
msgstr ""
"Taneɣruft n wawal issefk ad tili deg umawal. Senned ɣef yiwet tqeffalt!"

